# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# E.C.O.S — what Git protects
#
# Rule: Git tracks the BRAIN (governance + AI OS markdown) only.
# Bulk media, backups and archives are deliberately excluded —
# they live in Drive/Asset Library, which is their proper home.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Ignore everything at the root by default...
/*

# ...then re-include only what the brain needs:
!/.gitignore
!/CLAUDE.md
!/PROJECT_LOCATIONS.md
!/START_HERE.md
!/00_AI_OPERATING_SYSTEM/
!/03_ACTIVE_CAMPAIGNS/

# .claude: technical config (constitution §8). Track skills only, so desktop
# and cloud sessions run identical video-creation (and other) skills — never
# settings.json/settings.local.json, which can carry machine-local permission
# grants and must never carry credentials per §8 rule 1.
!/.claude/
!/.claude/skills/
!/.claude/skills/**
.claude/settings.json
.claude/settings.local.json

# ── 03_ACTIVE_CAMPAIGNS: track the strategy layer, not the media ──
# Campaign markdown/html is ~1.5MB and worth full version history.
# Campaign video is ~4.9GB and is NOT — its home is the Asset Library
# (constitution §9 rule 7: bulk media does not live in the AI OS).
# Video/images/audio are already excluded globally further down.
# These Office binaries are scoped to campaigns only — legacy .docx already
# tracked inside 00_AI_OPERATING_SYSTEM/99_ARCHIVE must stay tracked.
03_ACTIVE_CAMPAIGNS/**/*.docx
03_ACTIVE_CAMPAIGNS/**/*.xlsx
03_ACTIVE_CAMPAIGNS/**/*.doc
03_ACTIVE_CAMPAIGNS/**/*.xls

# ── Never tracked, anywhere ──
desktop.ini
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
*.tmp

# Google Drive placeholder stubs (contain no real content)
*.gdoc
*.gsheet
*.gslides
*.gform
*.gdraw
*.gjam
*.gmap

# Binary media — belongs in 01_ASSET_LIBRARY, not in Git
*.mp4
*.mov
*.mkv
*.avi
*.webm
*.mp3
*.wav
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.psd

# Archives — bulk media bundles (e.g. Canva/Meta ad exports). Same rule as
# above: the archive's home is the Asset Library, not Git history.
*.zip

# Extension-less Word document (verified: "Microsoft Word 2007+" by content).
# Excluded because it is a binary, not text. NOTE FOR EDMUND: this file has lost
# its .docx extension so nothing opens it by double-click — it should be renamed
# or (better, per constitution §9 rule 1) converted to markdown, after which this
# line can be deleted.
03_ACTIVE_CAMPAIGNS/01_ACTIVE/2026-07_LegacyLaunch_Meta_Wave1/01_CREATIVE/Scripts_Library/ANGLE_05_PORTFOLIO_SEQUENCE/1-LL_ANGLE1_OWNERSHIP_LIABILITY_v1

# Oversized PDF: 198MB, above GitHub's hard 100MB per-file limit — the push is
# rejected outright. THE SERRA ICB DECK_compressed.pdf (7.6MB) is tracked in its
# place and carries the same content. Per constitution §9 rule 7, the full-res
# original's home is the Asset Library, not Git.
03_ACTIVE_CAMPAIGNS/01_ACTIVE/2026-08_Serra residences/Raw Assets/THE SERRA ICB DECK.pdf
